{"id":"f4de10af6b469ac9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-enumerationproblem.md","title":"多项式有界解关系与NEXT-GEN","display":"df-enumerationproblem — 多项式有界解关系与NEXT-GEN","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-enumerationproblem","aliases":["27-df-enumerationproblem"],"display":"df-enumerationproblem — 多项式有界解关系与NEXT-GEN","depends_on":["[[27-df-bool]]","[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.8","source_printed_pages":"624–626","source_pdf_pages":"648–650","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-enumerationproblem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-enumerationproblem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-enumerationproblem — 多项式有界解关系与NEXT-GEN"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"624–626"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"648–650"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为有限字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为下式构造的有限字串集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*\">\\(\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1da79f596b2671f9\" href=\"?note=1da79f596b2671f9\" title=\"27-df-bool\">27-df-bool</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(D\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(v,w)\\in D\\;|v|\\le p(|w|)\">\\(\\forall(v,w)\\in D\\;|v|\\le p(|w|)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 表示非负整数系数的一元多项式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是固定符号。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span> 及单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}}\">\\(\\kappa:\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\">\\([r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为唯一描述，有限序列均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]\">\\([r]\\)</span> 为下标集。字串连接、有限列编码与 NEXT 输入/输出码由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^{[r]},\\qquad\\varepsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathtt0\\coloneqq\\{(1,0)\\},\\qquad\\mathtt1^{r}\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in[r]\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^*\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^{[r]},\\qquad\\varepsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathtt0\\coloneqq\\{(1,0)\\},\\qquad\\mathtt1^{r}\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in[r]\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\coloneqq\\{(i,u_i)\\mid i\\in[|u|]\\}\\cup\\{(|u|+j,v_j)\\mid j\\in[|v|]\\}\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\coloneqq\\{(i,u_i)\\mid i\\in[|u|]\\}\\cup\\{(|u|+j,v_j)\\mid j\\in[|v|]\\}\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cat}(())\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\\mathrm{cat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_r)\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_{r+1}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1}\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cat}(())\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\\mathrm{cat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_r)\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_{r+1}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1}\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cat}\\bigl((\\kappa(w_i))_{i\\in[|w|]}\\bigr)\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad |\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|=\\ell|w|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cat}\\bigl((\\kappa(w_i))_{i\\in[|w|]}\\bigr)\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad |\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|=\\ell|w|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(u)\\coloneqq2^{|u|}+\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\quad(u\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(u)\\coloneqq2^{|u|}+\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\quad(u\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^k\\;\n\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in K\\}\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\rho(u_i)&lt;\\rho(u_j))\\right)\n\\quad(K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|=k&lt;\\infty).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^k\\;\n\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in K\\}\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\rho(u_i)&lt;\\rho(u_j))\\right)\n\\quad(K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|=k&lt;\\infty).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{k}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\n\\mathrm{cat}\\left((\\mathtt1^{\\,|u_i|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_i)_{i\\in[k]}\\right)\n\\quad((u_1,\\ldots,u_k)=\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K),\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{k}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\n\\mathrm{cat}\\left((\\mathtt1^{\\,|u_i|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_i)_{i\\in[k]}\\right)\n\\quad((u_1,\\ldots,u_k)=\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K),\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K)\\coloneqq\n\\mathtt1^{\\,|\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\n\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K)\\coloneqq\n\\mathtt1^{\\,|\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\n\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{1}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\quad(v\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\mathtt0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{1}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\quad(v\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\mathtt0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_D(w)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*\\mid(v,w)\\in D\\},\\qquad m_D(w)\\coloneqq|S_D(w)|\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_D(w)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*\\mid(v,w)\\in D\\},\\qquad m_D(w)\\coloneqq|S_D(w)|\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Next}_D\\coloneqq\\left\\{((w,K),v)\\ \\middle|\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq S_D(w),\\ v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ \n(v\\in S_D(w)\\setminus K)\\lor(v=\\bot\\land K=S_D(w))\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Next}_D\\coloneqq\\left\\{((w,K),v)\\ \\middle|\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq S_D(w),\\ v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ \n(v\\in S_D(w)\\setminus K)\\lor(v=\\bot\\land K=S_D(w))\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>解长度的统一多项式界与有限字母表使每个解集有限；不要求 D 本身可判定。固定长度字母码是单射，ρ 对二进制字串单射，因此每个有限码集都有唯一的递增枚举，Ord 的唯一描述有定义。每一块都显式记录长度，空字串、空列表及含一个空字串的列表可以区分。NEXT 的有效输出以位 1 开头，结束标记编码为单独位 0，两者不冲突。合法 K 的输入码长度是 |w|+|K| 的多项式，因为每个成员长度至多 p(|w|)。这些码是为原枚举接口补齐的本地表示，不声称原书逐字给出这一编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bool","status":"resolved","id":"1da79f596b2671f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为有限字母表，$\\Sigma^*$ 为下式构造的有限字串集；$\\mathbb B,\\mathbb B^*$ 见 [[27-df-bool]]，$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[27-df-nat]]。$D\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*$，$p\\in\\mathbb N[X]$，$\\forall(v,w)\\in D\\;|v|\\le p(|w|)$；$\\mathbb N[X]$ 表示非负整数系数的一元多项式。$\\bot\\notin\\Sigma^*$ 是固定符号。固定 $\\ell\\in\\mathbb N^+$ 及单射 $\\kappa:\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb B^{\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}}$。$[r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}$；$\\iota$ 为唯一描述，有限序列均以 $[r]$ 为下标集。字串连接、有限列编码与 NEXT 输入/输出码由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"