|]}\\bigr)\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad |\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|=\\ell|w|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho(u)\\coloneqq2^{|u|}+\\sum_{i=1}^{|u|}u_i2^{|u|-i}\\quad(u\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^k\\;\n\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=\\{\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\mid v\\in K\\}\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i<j\\Rightarrow\\rho(u_i)<\\rho(u_j))\\right)\n\\quad(K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|=k<\\infty).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{k}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\n\\mathrm{cat}\\left((\\mathtt1^{\\,|u_i|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_i)_{i\\in[k]}\\right)\n\\quad((u_1,\\ldots,u_k)=\\mathrm{Ord}_\\kappa(K),\\ |K|<\\infty).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K)\\coloneqq\n\\mathtt1^{\\,|\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathtt0\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(w)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{List}_\\kappa(K)\n\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|<\\infty).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v)\\coloneqq\\mathtt1^{1}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa(v)\\quad(v\\in\\Sigma^*),\\qquad\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\mathtt0.","display":true},{"tex":"S_D(w)\\coloneqq\\{v\\in\\Sigma^*\\mid(v,w)\\in D\\},\\qquad m_D(w)\\coloneqq|S_D(w)|\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Next}_D\\coloneqq\\left\\{((w,K),v)\\ \\middle|\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq S_D(w),\\ v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\ \n(v\\in S_D(w)\\setminus K)\\lor(v=\\bot\\land K=S_D(w))\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3877,"backlinks":[{"id":"865d91735afbcff2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{enc}_\\kappa,S_D,m_D$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathcal U$、$\\mathrm{Run}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。下式将枚举器编码为 $A=\\langle M,o\\rangle$：$M$ 为现有确定型机器，$o$ 为该机器指定的非初始、非停机输出状态。输出事件、合法枚举器集合、输出时刻与复杂度谓词均由下式构造；$\\mathbb N[X]$ 沿用上述非负系数多项式集合。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-enumerationproblem|df-enumerationproblem — 多项式有界解关系与NEXT-GEN]]"},{"id":"a700eb7e844ad3ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]；$\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}$、$\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationtime]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Output}_N$、$\\mathrm{Time}_N$ 使用该定义的本目录上游接口。合法 NEXT 机器集合 $\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}$ 与运行时间 $T_{N,\\kappa}$ 由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["1da79f596b2671f9","d87d01e5686c19fe"]}